{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41674","headline":"和容南韦中丞题瑞亭白燕白鼠六眸龟嘉莲 · 陈陶","name":"和容南韦中丞题瑞亭白燕白鼠六眸龟嘉莲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"伏波恩行动南夷，交趾喧传四瑞诗。\n燕鼠孕灵褒上德，龟莲增耀荅无私。\n回翔雪侣窥檐处，照映红巢出水时。\n尽写流传在轩槛，嘉祥从此百年知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41674.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41674","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}